  "simplified": [
    "The shoreline follows the OSM coastline. Sloped rock faces and broad terraces stand in for individual cliffs, seawalls and paths.",
    "The prison, dining hall, administration wing, barracks and industrial buildings use their mapped plans. Repeated roof bays and a raised cellhouse roof convey the blocks at map scale.",
    "The lighthouse uses the 84-foot structure in the National Park Service landscape inventory. The water tank stands on four enlarged legs with separate concrete footings on the sloping rock. Handrails, windows, lettering and vegetation are omitted.",
    "Surveyed transects form irregular sloped rock and cliffs. The dock, parade ground and industries apron have distinct level surfaces. The exercise yard sits 8.48 m below the NPS crest.",
    "A perimeter wall encloses the mapped exercise yard. Broad roof monitors and a tapered chimney distinguish the northwestern workshops."
  ],
